<div id="2026-11-13-hk-recipe-plant-form" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-11-13 — Recipe detail is the second step; a preparation is not a new plant</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The meal-plan dish name opens the recipe detail. Rolled oats and hemp hearts are treated as preparations of oats and hemp, not as new plants. A missing plant opens add-herb for the plant name.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> The day card already opens the meal plan. The dish on that page was plain text, so the recipe steps were a dead end. Creating a “Rolled oats” herb would invent a plant.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>root/healthkitchen/mealplan.tt</code>, <code>lib/Comserv/Util/HealthKitchen/RecipeDetail.pm</code>, <code>root/healthkitchen/recipe.tt</code></p>
</div>
